+# src/validate — 4-layer validation gates
+
+| Layer | Script | Checks | Gate |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| A semantic | `validate_ab.py` | bag-of-lines text preservation per slide (+ Jaccard) | missing=0 |
+| B media | `validate_ab.py` | MD5 of source assets ↔ pptx-embedded media | all matched |
+| C visual | `pixel_c.mjs` | pixelmatch on WeasyPrint vs LibreOffice renders; chart bboxes masked | diffPct < 5 |
+| D geometric | `layout_d.py` | per-object IoU: IR bbox (intent) vs OOXML xfrm (declared) | worstIoU > 0.90, no critical |
+
+Layer D exists because renderers auto-repair wrong declared geometry — pixel
+diff alone misses it (docs/lessons.md #13). Chart regions are excluded from C
+and validated semantically via IR instead (#15). Orchestrated by `run.sh`
+(A+B and render prep run as parallel subflows).
